# Cloudflare Pages headers — security + caching for the static app.
# CSP third-party allowances (do not remove without checking the loaders):
# - cdn.jsdelivr.net: Clerk SDK (web/auth-ui.js loads clerk-js from jsDelivr)
# - challenges.cloudflare.com: Turnstile widget script + iframe + API (web/turnstile.js)
# - *.clerk.accounts.dev: Clerk Frontend API (dev instance beloved-gazelle-4678
#   + the future production instance, which will have a different subdomain);
#   also in script-src — clerk.load() may fetch UI code from the same host.
# - static.cloudflareinsights.com + cloudflareinsights.com: Web Analytics
#   beacon (web/analytics.js, token-gated — not live until a token is set)
# 2026-11-27: script-src was 'self' only, which blocked the Clerk SDK and
# broke sign-in on the preview (the SDK file itself loads fine — the browser
# refused it under CSP). See tests/test_csp.py.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://*.clerk.accounts.dev; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'self' https://web.archive.org https://archive.org https://*.clerk.accounts.dev https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; img-src 'self' data:; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/config.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
